# From the Catacombs on a creature card in Bot2's graveyard (Bot2 discarded its Ornithopter to hand size on turn 2): it
# enters under Bot1's control with a corpse counter. When Bot1 Lightning Bolts it, "if that creature would leave the
# battlefield, exile it instead": it goes to exile, not to its owner's graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
From the Catacombs
Lightning Bolt
Swamp x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x7
Ornithopter
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot2.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.From the Catacombs.Cast(Bot2.Graveyard.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Counters.Corpse = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile = Ornithopter
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 6
